@startuml
title Provider Send Result Mapping - Native Cause To Unified Send Enums

' 状态图保持默认黑白，不引入模块颜色。

legend right
  代码枚举节点直接显示真实来源：枚举类.枚举值
  示例：ConsumeDecision.ACK / SendFailureType.VALIDATION_ERROR
  LOGICAL = 查询、时间、次数、配置推导，代码枚举中不存在
  RUNTIME = 执行过程节点，代码枚举中不存在
  ACTION = repository / adapter 动作，不是状态枚举
  PROVIDER ACTION = Kafka / Pulsar / RocketMQ 原生确认动作
  PROVIDER CAUSE = Provider 原生返回或异常，不是统一状态枚举
  MESSAGE SEMANTIC = message-component 语义，目前不是持久化枚举
endlegend

state "PROVIDER_CALLING\nRUNTIME\nMessageProvider.send(request)" as R_PROVIDER_CALLING
state "KAFKA_NATIVE_RESULT\nPROVIDER CAUSE\nRecordMetadata / Kafka exception" as P_KAFKA
state "PULSAR_NATIVE_RESULT\nPROVIDER CAUSE\nMessageId / Pulsar exception" as P_PULSAR
state "ROCKETMQ_NATIVE_RESULT\nPROVIDER CAUSE\nSendResult / Remoting exception" as P_ROCKETMQ

state "NATIVE_CONFIRMED\nPROVIDER CAUSE\nBroker accepted and id returned" as P_CONFIRMED
state "NATIVE_REJECTED\nPROVIDER CAUSE\nschema/auth/route/parameter rejected" as P_REJECTED
state "NATIVE_FAILED\nPROVIDER CAUSE\nconnection/client failure before confirm" as P_FAILED
state "NATIVE_UNKNOWN\nPROVIDER CAUSE\nrequest timed out / broker outcome uncertain" as P_UNKNOWN

state "CONFIRMED\nSendStatus.CONFIRMED" as ST_CONFIRMED
state "FAILED\nSendStatus.FAILED" as ST_FAILED
state "REJECTED\nSendStatus.REJECTED" as ST_REJECTED
state "UNKNOWN\nSendStatus.UNKNOWN" as ST_UNKNOWN

state "NONE\nSendFailureType.NONE" as F_NONE
state "SERIALIZATION_ERROR\nSendFailureType.SERIALIZATION_ERROR" as F_SERIALIZATION
state "AUTHORIZATION_ERROR\nSendFailureType.AUTHORIZATION_ERROR" as F_AUTHORIZATION
state "NETWORK_ERROR\nSendFailureType.NETWORK_ERROR" as F_NETWORK
state "TIMEOUT\nSendFailureType.TIMEOUT" as F_TIMEOUT
state "BROKER_REJECTED\nSendFailureType.BROKER_REJECTED" as F_BROKER_REJECTED
state "CLIENT_ERROR\nSendFailureType.CLIENT_ERROR" as F_CLIENT
state "UNKNOWN_OUTCOME\nSendFailureType.UNKNOWN_OUTCOME" as F_UNKNOWN_OUTCOME

[*] --> R_PROVIDER_CALLING
R_PROVIDER_CALLING --> P_KAFKA : kafka provider
R_PROVIDER_CALLING --> P_PULSAR : pulsar provider
R_PROVIDER_CALLING --> P_ROCKETMQ : rocketmq provider

P_KAFKA --> P_CONFIRMED : RecordMetadata returned
P_KAFKA --> P_REJECTED : SerializationException / AuthorizationException
P_KAFKA --> P_FAILED : NetworkException / DisconnectException
P_KAFKA --> P_UNKNOWN : timeout waiting ack

P_PULSAR --> P_CONFIRMED : MessageId returned
P_PULSAR --> P_REJECTED : authorization / schema rejected
P_PULSAR --> P_FAILED : connection failure before confirm
P_PULSAR --> P_UNKNOWN : timeout before final confirm

P_ROCKETMQ --> P_CONFIRMED : SEND_OK
P_ROCKETMQ --> P_UNKNOWN : FLUSH_DISK_TIMEOUT / FLUSH_SLAVE_TIMEOUT / SLAVE_NOT_AVAILABLE
P_ROCKETMQ --> P_FAILED : RemotingConnectException / client failure
P_ROCKETMQ --> P_REJECTED : topic / route / auth / parameter rejected

P_CONFIRMED --> ST_CONFIRMED
P_CONFIRMED --> F_NONE
F_NONE --> ST_CONFIRMED

P_REJECTED --> ST_REJECTED
P_REJECTED --> F_SERIALIZATION : serialization/schema
P_REJECTED --> F_AUTHORIZATION : auth
P_REJECTED --> F_BROKER_REJECTED : broker rejects request

P_FAILED --> ST_FAILED
P_FAILED --> F_NETWORK : connection/network
P_FAILED --> F_CLIENT : client-side failure

P_UNKNOWN --> ST_UNKNOWN
P_UNKNOWN --> F_TIMEOUT : timeout
P_UNKNOWN --> F_UNKNOWN_OUTCOME : broker outcome uncertain

ST_CONFIRMED --> [*]
ST_FAILED --> [*]
ST_REJECTED --> [*]
ST_UNKNOWN --> [*]
F_SERIALIZATION --> [*]
F_AUTHORIZATION --> [*]
F_BROKER_REJECTED --> [*]
F_NETWORK --> [*]
F_CLIENT --> [*]
F_TIMEOUT --> [*]
F_UNKNOWN_OUTCOME --> [*]

note right of P_ROCKETMQ
  RocketMQ FLUSH_* 不应标成 REJECTED。
  它表示刷盘/同步链路不完整，更接近 UNKNOWN。
end note
@enduml
